cket.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d3d0dbf9fa1bc59b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA- Digital Journalism from Goldsmiths, University of London - Fees, Requirements, Ranking, Eligibility, Scholarship\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d3d0dbf9fa1bc59b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.shiksha.com/studyabroad/uk/universities/goldsmiths-university-of-london/ma-digital-journalism\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"53617b5f6a96f431\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe tuition fees to pursue this program is <strong>Pound 20000.0</strong>. English language proficiency test accepted for admission to Goldsmiths, University of London MA- Digital Journalism is IELTS.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"53617b5f6a96f431\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.shiksha.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b8151a0f99ba549c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA in Journalism 2025 – Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b8151a0f99ba549c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.idp.com/universities-and-colleges/goldsmiths-university-of-london/ma-in-journalism/PRG-UK-00082782/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7b47099e5de99e11\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStudy MA in Journalism at Goldsmiths, University of London. Find course fees, eligibility criteria and 2026 scholarships – Apply for September intake today!\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7b47099e5de99e11\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.idp.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"706df97744cf362a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA Journalism Postgraduate Programme By Goldsmiths, University of London |TopUniversities\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"706df97744cf362a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.topuniversities.com/univers