s should normally have a <strong>minimum IELTS score of 7.0 or equivalent</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1b105e2acc417301\">>>", "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3005674f204b6287\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Journalism | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3005674f204b6287\">>>", "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-journalism/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b61181efa23cd4d1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nStudy in London – rich in culture and history, and voted the best student city in the world (QS Best Student Cities 2025) ... We offer excellent hands-on experience using a range of specialist facilities and equipment. ... The programme is divided into a series of modules that cover the key practical skills and theoretical background. There are no optional modules or alternate pathways. Practice modules are largely assessed by portfolios of your work, while theory modules are all assessed by essays or written research work. ... In addition to the compulsory modules, you will select skills-based optional modules equal to the value of 30 credits, chosen from an approved list published annually.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b61181efa23cd4d1\">>>", "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"12b26807682efc32\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA/MSc Digital Journalism | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"12b26807682efc32\">>>", "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-digital-journalism/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"470aa57b8f42aab6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIf English isn’t your first language, you will need an IELTS score (or equivalent English language qualification) of 7.0 with a 7.0 in writing and no element lower than 6.5 to study this programme. If you need assistance with your English language, we offer a range of courses that can help prepare you for postgraduate-level study. Apply directly to Goldsmiths using our online application system\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"470aa57b8f42aab6\">>>", "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a4d74b739fc62fd1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA in Digital Journalism at Goldsmiths, University of London : Admission 2025-26, Requirements & Fees\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a4d74b739fc62fd1\">>>", "url": "https://yocket.com/universities/goldsmiths-university-of-london/digital-journalism-97814", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"12a2fca7e7882057\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA in Digital Journalism at Goldsmiths, University Of London 2025-26: Check Course Fees, Eligibility, Scholarships &amp; Application Deadline for Digital Journalism at Goldsmiths, University Of London at Yocket.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"12a2fca7e7882057\">>>", "siteName": "yocket.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2278462764f75439\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nJournalism at Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2278462764f75439\">>>", "url": "https://digital.ucas.com/coursedisplay/courses/405d02ba-c83c-c28a-165c-2caf9fec213b?SearchText=", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6cdb209010deb5bf\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCourses, apprenticeships, information guides and more · Why study MA Journalism at Goldsmiths Accredited with distinction by the Professional Publishers Association, this practical MA gives you the essential skills to work as a journalist for multiple audiences across myriad platforms\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6cdb209010deb5bf\">>>", "siteName": "digital.ucas.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"07d93f8c7b3ee40b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA in Journalism at Goldsmiths, University of London : Admission 2025-26, Requirements & Fees\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id