{"type": "message", "id": "9e149c87", "parentId": "ef1ae3c6", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T16:09:44.873Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_6640020d617a4dcba71500ac", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Goldsmiths MA Virtual Augmented Reality MA/MSc Virtual Augmented Reality fees IELTS compulsory modules\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 920,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"00c79fb26fe8de49\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA/MSc Virtual and Augmented Reality | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"00c79fb26fe8de49\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-msc-virtual-augmented-reality/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bb3edb7dba180517\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIf English isn’t your first language, you will need an IELTS score (or equivalent English language qualification) of 6.5 with no element lower than 6.0 to study this programme. If you need assistance with your English language, we offer a range of courses that can help prepare you for postgraduate-level study. Apply directly to Goldsmiths using our online application system.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bb3edb7dba180517\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3cb255dbbba01e39\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoldsmiths, University of London MA / MSc Virtual & Augmented Reality\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3cb255dbbba01e39\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.educations.com/institutions/goldsmiths-university-of-london/ma-msc-virtual-augmented-reality\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTE